<?page title="Responsive Utilities" contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8"?>
<zk xmlns:h="native">
<style src="~./usecase/usecase.css"/>
<div sclass="z-p-8">
    <div sclass="z-h3 z-text-on-surface z-mb-2">Responsive Utilities</div>
    <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-4 z-border-bottom z-pb-4">
        兩種「依尺寸調整版面」的工具：<h:b>依 viewport</h:b>（視窗寬度）與 <h:b>依 container</h:b>（容器寬度）。
        本頁用實際情境示範怎麼用，每個情境都附上原始碼；最後一節說明如何客製 breakpoint。
    </div>

    <!-- prefer-intrinsic callout -->
    <div sclass="z-bg-secondary-container z-rounded z-p-3 z-text-sm z-mb-8">
        <h:b>先試 intrinsic</h:b>：彼此獨立的卡片牆／儀表板磚，優先用 <h:code>z-grid-fill</h:code>（欄數隨寬度自動增減、<h:b>零 breakpoint</h:b>，見 <h:code>grid-utilities.zul</h:code> 或側邊「Layout」）。
        只有真的需要「窄螢幕隱藏側欄、堆疊↔並排、某元素只在手機顯示」時，才用底下的 breakpoint utility。
    </div>

    <!-- ============================================================= -->
    <!-- PART 1 — viewport -->
    <!-- ============================================================= -->
    <div sclass="z-text-lg z-fw-semibold z-text-primary z-mt-4 z-mb-4">第 1 部分 · 依 viewport（視窗寬度）</div>

    <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-3">
        <h:code>z-d-{value}-{bp}</h:code> = 「viewport ≥ bp 時 <h:code>display:{value}</h:code>」。採 <h:b>mobile-first</h:b>：
        無後綴的 <h:code>z-d-*</h:code> 覆蓋最小的 xs（0），<h:code>-{bp}</h:code> 在該寬度<h:b>以上</h:b>疊加覆寫。
        <h:code>value</h:code> 可用 <h:code>none / block / flex / grid / inline-block</h:code>。
    </div>

    <!-- breakpoint scale table -->
    <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-auto z-col-gap-4 z-row-gap-2 z-mb-8 z-align-center" style="--zk-cols: 2; --zk-col-min: 120px">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary">縮寫</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary">最小寬度</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary">範例 class</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-fw-medium">xs</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">0（base）</div><div sclass="z-text-sm"><h:code>z-d-none</h:code> <h:code>z-d-flex</h:code></div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-fw-medium">sm</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">600px</div><div sclass="z-text-sm"><h:code>z-d-block-sm</h:code></div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-fw-medium">md</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">900px</div><div sclass="z-text-sm"><h:code>z-d-flex-md</h:code></div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-fw-medium">lg</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">1200px</div><div sclass="z-text-sm"><h:code>z-d-none-lg</h:code></div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-fw-medium">xl</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">1536px</div><div sclass="z-text-sm"><h:code>z-d-grid-xl</h:code></div>
    </div>

    <!-- 1.1 hide sidebar on mobile -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-3">情境 1.1 · 手機隱藏側欄，桌機顯示</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-3">
            側欄在窄螢幕佔空間、桌機才有用。base 設 <h:code>z-d-none</h:code>（手機隱藏），再用 <h:code>z-d-block-md</h:code> 於 ≥md 顯示。
            <h:b>↔ 把視窗拉到 &lt; 900px，側欄消失。</h:b>
        </div>
        <div sclass="z-d-flex z-gap-3 z-mb-3">
            <div sclass="z-d-none z-d-block-md z-bg-primary-container z-rounded z-p-3 z-text-sm" style="width:180px">側欄 · ≥md 才顯示</div>
            <div sclass="z-flex-1 z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-p-3 z-text-sm">主內容 · 永遠顯示</div>
        </div>
        <h:pre class="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-p-3 z-text-sm z-overflow-x-auto"><![CDATA[<div class="z-d-flex z-gap-3">
    <aside class="z-d-none z-d-block-md">側欄</aside>   <!-- 手機隱藏，>= md 顯示 -->
    <main class="z-flex-1">主內容</main>
</div>]]></h:pre>
    </div>

    <!-- 1.2 hamburger vs nav links -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-3">情境 1.2 · 手機顯示漢堡鈕，桌機顯示完整選單</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-3">
            互斥的一對：漢堡鈕 <h:code>z-d-block z-d-none-md</h:code>（只在 &lt;md 顯示）、選單列 <h:code>z-d-none z-d-flex-md</h:code>（≥md 才顯示）。
            <h:b>↔ 拉窄視窗，選單列換成漢堡鈕。</h:b>
        </div>
        <div sclass="z-d-flex z-align-center z-justify-between z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-p-3 z-mb-3">
            <div sclass="z-fw-semibold z-text-sm">Logo</div>
            <div sclass="z-d-block z-d-none-md z-bg-primary-container z-rounded z-py-1 z-px-3 z-text-sm z-fw-medium">☰ 選單</div>
            <div sclass="z-d-none z-d-flex-md z-gap-4 z-text-sm">
                <div>首頁</div><div>產品</div><div>定價</div><div>關於</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <h:pre class="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-p-3 z-text-sm z-overflow-x-auto"><![CDATA[<nav class="z-d-flex z-align-center z-justify-between">
    <span>Logo</span>
    <button class="z-d-block z-d-none-md">☰ 選單</button>   <!-- 只在 < md 顯示 -->
    <div class="z-d-none z-d-flex-md z-gap-4">              <!-- >= md 才顯示 -->
        <a>首頁</a><a>產品</a><a>定價</a><a>關於</a>
    </div>
</nav>]]></h:pre>
    </div>

    <!-- 1.3 stack to horizontal -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-3">情境 1.3 · 手機堆疊，桌機並排（切換版面）</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-3">
            純 <h:code>display</h:code> 切換：base <h:code>z-d-block</h:code>（區塊堆疊），≥md 用 <h:code>z-d-flex-md</h:code> 排成一列。
            <h:code>z-gap-3</h:code> 在 flex 模式才生效。<h:b>↔ 拉寬到 ≥900px，三塊並排。</h:b>
        </div>
        <div sclass="z-d-block z-d-flex-md z-gap-3 z-mb-3">
            <div sclass="z-bg-primary-container z-rounded z-p-4 z-flex-1 z-mb-2 z-text-sm">Panel A</div>
            <div sclass="z-bg-primary-container z-rounded z-p-4 z-flex-1 z-mb-2 z-text-sm">Panel B</div>
            <div sclass="z-bg-primary-container z-rounded z-p-4 z-flex-1 z-mb-2 z-text-sm">Panel C</div>
        </div>
        <h:pre class="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-p-3 z-text-sm z-overflow-x-auto"><![CDATA[<div class="z-d-block z-d-flex-md z-gap-3">   <!-- block(堆疊) < md，flex(並排) >= md -->
    <div class="z-flex-1">Panel A</div>
    <div class="z-flex-1">Panel B</div>
    <div class="z-flex-1">Panel C</div>
</div>]]></h:pre>
    </div>

    <!-- 1.4 breakpoint reference chips -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-3">情境 1.4 · 各 breakpoint 對照（拉動視窗觀察）</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-3">
            每個標籤只在對應區間顯示。<h:b>↔ 拉動視窗寬度，觀察它們逐一出現／消失</h:b>——這是最快確認斷點的方式。
        </div>
        <div sclass="z-d-flex z-gap-2 z-flex-wrap z-align-center z-mb-3">
            <div sclass="z-bg-secondary-container z-rounded-xs z-py-2 z-px-3 z-text-sm z-fw-medium z-d-block z-d-none-sm">顯示於 &lt; sm (&lt;600)</div>
            <div sclass="z-bg-primary-container z-rounded-xs z-py-2 z-px-3 z-text-sm z-fw-medium z-d-none z-d-block-sm">顯示於 ≥ sm (600)</div>
            <div sclass="z-bg-primary-container z-rounded-xs z-py-2 z-px-3 z-text-sm z-fw-medium z-d-none z-d-block-md">顯示於 ≥ md (900)</div>
            <div sclass="z-bg-primary-container z-rounded-xs z-py-2 z-px-3 z-text-sm z-fw-medium z-d-none z-d-block-lg">顯示於 ≥ lg (1200)</div>
            <div sclass="z-bg-primary-container z-rounded-xs z-py-2 z-px-3 z-text-sm z-fw-medium z-d-none z-d-block-xl">顯示於 ≥ xl (1536)</div>
        </div>
        <h:pre class="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-p-3 z-text-sm z-overflow-x-auto"><![CDATA[<div class="z-d-block z-d-none-sm">顯示於 < sm</div>   <!-- 只在 < 600 顯示 -->
<div class="z-d-none z-d-block-md">顯示於 >= md</div>  <!-- 只在 >= 900 顯示 -->]]></h:pre>
    </div>

    <!-- ============================================================= -->
    <!-- PART 2 — container queries -->
    <!-- ============================================================= -->
    <div sclass="z-text-lg z-fw-semibold z-text-primary z-mt-4 z-mb-4">第 2 部分 · 依 container（容器寬度）</div>

    <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-3">
        讓元件依<h:b>自己容器的寬度</h:b>調整，而不是 viewport——同一個元件放到寬區或窄側欄會各自適應，最適合儀表板磚、split pane。
        用 <h:code>z-container</h:code>（<h:code>container-type: inline-size</h:code>）標記查詢容器，其後代用 <h:code>z-cq-{value}-{bp}</h:code> 反應<h:b>該容器</h:b>的寬度。斷點尺度與第 1 部分相同（sm/md/lg/xl）。
    </div>

    <!-- 2.1 card adapts to its container -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-6">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-3">情境 2.1 · 同一張卡片，依容器寬度自我調整</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-3">
            下面三塊是<h:b>完全相同的 markup</h:b>，只有容器寬度不同（300 / 700 / 950px），因此各自呈現不同版面——<h:b>不需要拉動視窗</h:b>。
            body 用 <h:code>z-d-block z-cq-flex-md</h:code>（容器 &lt;md 堆疊、≥md 並排）、Details 用 <h:code>z-cq-none z-cq-block-sm</h:code>（容器 &lt;sm 隱藏）。
        </div>
        <div sclass="z-vstack z-gap-4 z-mb-3">
            <div>
                <div sclass="z-text-xs z-text-muted z-mb-1">容器寬 300px（&lt; sm）→ 堆疊、無 Details</div>
                <div sclass="z-overflow-x-auto">
                    <div sclass="z-container z-bg-surface-low z-border z-rounded z-p-3" style="width:300px">
                        <div sclass="z-d-block z-cq-flex-md z-gap-3 z-align-center">
                            <div sclass="z-bg-primary-container z-rounded z-p-3 z-flex-1 z-mb-2 z-text-sm">Summary</div>
                            <div sclass="z-bg-secondary-container z-rounded z-p-3 z-flex-1 z-mb-2 z-text-sm z-cq-none z-cq-block-sm">Details · ≥sm 容器</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div sclass="z-text-xs z-text-muted z-mb-1">容器寬 700px（≥ sm, &lt; md）→ 堆疊、有 Details</div>
                <div sclass="z-overflow-x-auto">
                    <div sclass="z-container z-bg-surface-low z-border z-rounded z-p-3" style="width:700px">
                        <div sclass="z-d-block z-cq-flex-md z-gap-3 z-align-center">
                            <div sclass="z-bg-primary-container z-rounded z-p-3 z-flex-1 z-mb-2 z-text-sm">Summary</div>
                            <div sclass="z-bg-secondary-container z-rounded z-p-3 z-flex-1 z-mb-2 z-text-sm z-cq-none z-cq-block-sm">Details · ≥sm 容器</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div sclass="z-text-xs z-text-muted z-mb-1">容器寬 950px（≥ md）→ 並排、有 Details</div>
                <div sclass="z-overflow-x-auto">
                    <div sclass="z-container z-bg-surface-low z-border z-rounded z-p-3" style="width:950px">
                        <div sclass="z-d-block z-cq-flex-md z-gap-3 z-align-center">
                            <div sclass="z-bg-primary-container z-rounded z-p-3 z-flex-1 z-mb-2 z-text-sm">Summary</div>
                            <div sclass="z-bg-secondary-container z-rounded z-p-3 z-flex-1 z-mb-2 z-text-sm z-cq-none z-cq-block-sm">Details · ≥sm 容器</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <h:pre class="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-p-3 z-text-sm z-overflow-x-auto"><![CDATA[<div class="z-container">                          <!-- 標記查詢容器（必要） -->
    <div class="z-d-block z-cq-flex-md z-gap-3">  <!-- 容器 >= md 並排，否則堆疊 -->
        <div class="z-flex-1">Summary</div>
        <div class="z-cq-none z-cq-block-sm">Details</div>  <!-- 容器 >= sm 才顯示 -->
    </div>
</div>]]></h:pre>
        <div sclass="z-bg-secondary-container z-rounded z-p-3 z-text-sm z-mt-3">
            <h:b>關鍵前提</h:b>：<h:code>z-cq-*</h:code> 必須有 <h:code>z-container</h:code> 祖先才有可量測的容器——請<h:b>成對使用</h:b>。
            斷點量的是<h:b>容器</h:b>的 inline size，不是 viewport。
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ============================================================= -->
    <!-- PART 3 — customization -->
    <!-- ============================================================= -->
    <div sclass="z-text-lg z-fw-semibold z-text-primary z-mt-4 z-mb-4">第 3 部分 · 客製化</div>

    <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-3">
        <h:b>斷點數值不是 runtime CSS 變數。</h:b>CSS 規定 <h:code>@media</h:code> / <h:code>@container</h:code> 的條件<h:b>不能</h:b>讀 <h:code>var()</h:code>，
        所以 sm/md/lg/xl 是<h:b>編譯期常數</h:b>。要調整就改 <h:code>_layout.css</h:code> 裡的 4 組 <h:code>@media</h:code> 與 4 組 <h:code>@container</h:code> 後重新 build——集中在一處、好維護。
    </div>
    <h:pre class="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-p-3 z-text-sm z-overflow-x-auto"><![CDATA[/* src/main/resources/web/zul/css/utility/_layout.css */
@media (min-width: 900px) {      /* md 斷點：改這個 px */
    .z-d-block-md { display: block; }
    .z-d-flex-md  { display: flex; }
    ...
}
@container (min-width: 900px) {  /* 對應的 container 斷點也一起改 */
    .z-cq-block-md { display: block; }
    ...
}
/* 改完： npm run build:css */]]></h:pre>

    <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mt-4 z-mb-3">
        真正<h:b>可在 runtime 覆寫的變數</h:b>是 intrinsic grid 的旋鈕（不是斷點）——可在 <h:code>:root</h:code> 全站覆寫，或就地 inline 覆寫：
    </div>
    <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-auto z-col-gap-4 z-row-gap-2 z-mb-3 z-align-center" style="--zk-cols: 1; --zk-col-min: 200px">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary">變數</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary">用途</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm"><h:code>--zk-grid-min</h:code></div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary"><h:code>z-grid-fill</h:code> 每欄最小寬（預設 180px）</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm"><h:code>--zk-grid-min-xs / -sm / -lg / -xl</h:code></div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary"><h:code>z-grid-fill-xs…xl</h:code> 對應的具名尺寸</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm"><h:code>--zk-cols</h:code></div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary"><h:code>z-grid-cols-auto</h:code> 的資料欄數（預設 1）</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm"><h:code>--zk-col-min</h:code></div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary"><h:code>z-grid-cols-auto</h:code> 每欄最小寬（預設 0）</div>
    </div>
    <h:pre class="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-p-3 z-text-sm z-overflow-x-auto"><![CDATA[/* 全站覆寫：卡片牆改成每欄至少 220px */
:root { --zk-grid-min: 220px; }

/* 或就地覆寫單一區塊 */
<div class="z-d-grid z-grid-fill z-gap-4" style="--zk-grid-min: 240px"> ... </div>]]></h:pre>
    <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mt-3">
        這些 grid 旋鈕的完整說明見 <h:code>grid-utilities.zul</h:code> 與 <h:code>doc/spec/responsive-design.md</h:code>。
    </div>

</div>
</zk>
